+# Wire format
+
+The project's current recorded decision is to use CBOR (Concise Binary Object Representation) as the wire serialisation format. This comes from a single statement by the project's user that has not been confirmed by a commit or any other check, so treat it as the current stated direction rather than an implemented or verified state.
